---
layout: default
subject: "Payment needed to keep {{plan}}"
---
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>{{#if trial}}Your <strong>{{plan}}</strong> trial has ended.{{else}}Your <strong>{{plan}}</strong> subscription renews for {{period_start}} – {{period_end}}.{{/if}} Log in and pay by <strong>{{grace_until}}</strong> to keep {{plan}}.</p>
<p style="margin: 28px 0; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">{{amount}} {{currency}}</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="{{pay_url}}">Log in and pay</a></p>
<p>The paid period runs {{period_start}} – {{period_end}}. Your invoice is e-mailed once the payment is through.</p>
